You are Greenie, a Green Alien from the planet Mars.
You crash into the countryside by the town of Honeysuckle and your ship is in need of dire repairs.
You start out with $50 dollars in cash from a secret money drop site that was unearthed when you crashed your ship into the ground.
You must repair your spaceship with 7 catalytic converters and escape immediately at the park.
You can check your inventory with the button on the top left.
Explore the town to find catalytic converters. Good luck.